    <string name="tutorial_1_title">READ THE LANE SIGNAL</string>
    <string name="tutorial_1_body">EVERY LANE CARRIES A BAR ON ITS EDGE. CYAN MEANS THE GAP IS WIDE, MAGENTA MEANS A VEHICLE IS CLOSE.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_2_title">HOP ONE LANE FORWARD</string>
    <string name="tutorial_2_body">PRESS THE CENTRE SIGNAL BUTTON TO HOP INTO THE NEXT LANE. THE SIDE BUTTONS SHIFT YOUR COLUMN.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_3_title">GRAB ROUTE BADGES</string>
    <string name="tutorial_3_body">BADGES SIT IN EXPOSED CELLS. EACH ONE ADDS FOUR SECONDS, SCORE AND A FEATHER CHARGE.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_4_title">PERCH AND BANK YOUR STREAK</string>
    <string name="tutorial_4_body">HAY BALES IN THE MEDIAN BANK YOUR STREAK FOR EXTRA SECONDS AND A BONUS SCORE.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_done">TUTORIAL COMPLETE</string>

